  "post_content": "<p>(60 fotos) La parella formada per Manu Llorens i Arturo Mart&iacute;n han guanyat a mitjanit d&#39;aquest dijous el I Torneig de Futbillar que s&#39;ha jugat a Druida Bar&amp;Drinks, al carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 d&#39;Onda. Subcampions han quedat David Romero i H&eacute;ctor Gil. El bronze ha sigut per a Salva Cerezuela i David Cintas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/GuanyadorsFutbillarDruida.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En quarta posici&oacute; han quedat Iv&aacute;n Garcia i Jos&eacute; D. Robles.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9706.jpg\" alt=\"img_9706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9712.jpg\" alt=\"img_9712\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9713.jpg\" alt=\"img_9713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9714.jpg\" alt=\"img_9714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9716.jpg\" alt=\"img_9716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9717.jpg\" alt=\"img_9717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9718.jpg\" alt=\"img_9718\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img_9719.jpg\" alt=\"img_9719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidafutbillar/img